                            <comment id="16519330" author="sergey-chugunov" created="Thu, 21 Jun 2018 12:53:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=VitaliyB&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;VitaliyB&quot;&gt;VitaliyB&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I triggered &lt;b&gt;ZooKeeper (Discovery) 2&lt;/b&gt; suite, results look good to me: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1374005&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_ZooKeeperDiscovery1&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TC link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We can proceed with merging.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16519560" author="dpavlov" created="Thu, 21 Jun 2018 16:28:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=VitaliyB&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;VitaliyB&quot;&gt;VitaliyB&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sergey-chugunov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sergey-chugunov&quot;&gt;sergey-chugunov&lt;/a&gt;, I&apos;ve added several changes related to code style and merged change.&lt;/p&gt;

